                                                        <rect key="frame" x="12" y="62" width="319" height="216"/>
                                                        <string key="text">To whom it may concern,I am writing to formally request a leave of
absence for 3 days due to a severe seasonal
flu. My physician has advised immediate bed
rest and isolation to ensure a full recovery and
to prevent the spread of illness within the
campus environment.I have coordinated with my classmates to
collect any lecture notes or assignments
distributed during these dates. I intend to
keep up with my coursework remotely as my
health permits.</string>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Urbanist-Regular" family="Urbanist" pointSize="15"/>
                                                        <color key="textColor" white="0.33333333329999998" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="genericGamma22GrayColorSpace"/>
